  concept:B('An interior point with equal perpendicular distances to the sides lies on the internal bisector. The equal distances are inputs here, whereas they were the goal of the forward proof.','角內點到兩邊的垂直距離相等，則該點在內角平分線上。這一課把等距當已知；上一課則以等距為待證結論。'),
